<title>USA: Paradigm Tech says CFO Schirle resigns.</title>
<headline>Paradigm Tech says CFO Schirle resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradigm Technology Inc, a designer and seller of static random access memory semiconductors, on Tuesday said Chief Financial Officer Douglas Schirle has resigned due to health reasons.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said it has yet to find a replacement for Schirle, though it expects to announce an appointment &quot;in the near future.&quot;</p>
